kernel-spec/libwasm — libwasm (MIT) + druntime-wasm
===================================================

Copied from `riscv-compilers/libwasm` as a **spec of record** for WASM-JIT
druntime conformity (`CRuntime_LIBWASM`, `WasmAllocator`, handle-table
imports, `Object_Call_*` / `fetch`). Do not compile, flist, or link this
tree into `g6b-*`. Do not relicense; keep LICENSE.md verbatim.

Excluded from the copy: `tmp/`, `runtime-v1.*` snapshots, `*.a` / `*.exe`,
examples, tests. First-party rewrite: `crates/g6b-wasm` + `g6b-http` (MIT).
See `architecture/KERNEL-API.md` and `architecture/WASM.md`.
